## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.2 Sol
- **Short description:** OpenAI's rumored cost-efficient tier of the GPT-6.2 family — the sibling of the rumored GPT-6.2 Astra — sighted through unverified Codex usage-analytics / developer reports and Google Cloud console quota screenshots; no official announcement, release date, spec, pricing or benchmark from OpenAI.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI — reported API model ID `openai/gpt-6.2-sol`; Chat Completions / Responses API; status: unannounced (no official API changelog entry, no newsroom post, no models-listing entry).
- **Release / knowledge:** Not announced as of 2026-11-13; GPT-6.1 Sol (the confirmed prior tier) released 2026-09-30.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-6.2-sol` (reported); confirmed prior: `openai/gpt-6.1-sol` (API standard pricing $2/M input / $10/M output, 1,050,000-token context).
- **Context window:** Not established for GPT-6.2 Sol; the confirmed GPT-6.1 Sol entry documents a 1,050,000-token context.
- **Modalities:** Not established for GPT-6.2 Sol.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Not announced; confirmed prior GPT-6.1 Sol pricing $2/M input / $10/M output.
- **Architecture:** Not established.

