### Cross-source comparison

- Official OpenAI sources (GPT-6 Astra launch post + system card, GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Sol/Luna, GPT-6-Cyber, safety overview): contain no GPT-6.2 Sol material; OpenAI's newsroom, API changelog and API models listings were checked and show no GPT-6.2 entry as of 2026-11-13.
- Independent coverage (TestingCatalog Codex usage-analytics report, geotoolbox.ai GPT-6.2 synthesis, EvoLink GPT-6.2 release watch, The Information, Google Cloud console quota screenshots, silent-routing reports): all describe sightings / rumors / expectations — none yield a standardized, independently reproducible public benchmark number for the GPT-6.2 Sol identity.

